[32m+[m[32m# AI-Powered HOTS Question Generator Using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mA university-focused AI system that generates Higher Order Thinking Skills (HOTS) questions from academic course materials using RAG.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Project Overview[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Target Bloom's Levels:** Apply, Analyze, Evaluate, Create[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Input Sources:** Syllabi, Lecture PPTs/PPTXs, PDF notes, Reference Books, Previous CAT/FAT Papers (as teaching examples)[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Database & Retrieval:** MongoDB + MongoDB Atlas Vector Search[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Backend:** FastAPI (Python 3.12)[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Frontend:** React[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Project Architecture & Directory Layout[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mproject-root/[m
[32m+[m[32m│[m
[32m+[m[32m├── frontend/                  # React frontend application[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── student/               # Public student UI (course search, topic selection, question generation)[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── developer/             # Protected developer UI (/dev - upload, syllabus alignment, knowledge base)[m
[32m+[m[32m│   └── package.json           # Frontend dependencies configuration[m
[32m+[m[32m│[m
[32m+[m[32m├── backend/                   # FastAPI modular backend service[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── .venv/                 # Local Python virtual environment (ignored by Git)[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── api/                   # API routes and router declarations[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── auth/                  # JWT authentication for Developer Mode[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── core/                  # Configuration, logging, environment settings[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── database/              # MongoDB client and Atlas Vector Search interfaces[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── ingestion/             # Document extraction, OCR, syllabus alignment, chunking[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── retrieval/             # Metadata filtering and semantic search pipelines[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── generation/            # Prompt engineering and Gemini/Gemma LLM integration[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── validation/            # HOTS question quality and schema validation[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── models/                # Pydantic schemas and database models[m
[32m+[m[32m│   ├── services/              # Business logic coordinating pipelines and database[m
[32m+[m[32m│   └── requirements.txt       # Backend dependencies specification[m
[32m+[m[32m│[m
[32m+[m[32m├── tests/                     # Automated test suites[m
[32m+[m[32m├── docker/                    # Docker configuration[m
[32m+[m[32m│   └── Dockerfile             # Container definition for backend and OCR services[m
[32m+[m[32m├── .env.example               # Environment variables template[m
[32m+[m[32m├── .gitignore                 # Git ignore rules[m
[32m+[m[32m└── README.md                  # Project documentation[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
